#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000001
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000001
msgid "Non-lethal, high-voltage electric shock weapon. Press and hold <I=ATK> to use. Its strength increases the more it is used."
msgstr "非致命高压电击武器。按住<I=ATK>使用。使用次数越多威力越强。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000002
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000002
msgid "Non-lethal tranquilizer pistol. Rounds take effect after a period of time. While equipped with a suppressor, it is of low durability and wears out relatively fast."
msgstr "非致命麻醉手枪。子弹需一段时间才生效。带消音器，耐久度低，损耗较快。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000003
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000004
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000005
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000006
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000003
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000004
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000005
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000006
msgid "Non-lethal tranquilizer pistol. Rounds take effect after a period of time. Suppressor durability has been increased through R&D. "
msgstr "非致命麻醉手枪。子弹需一段时间才生效。经研发消音器耐久度提升。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000007
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000007
msgid "Special, non-lethal pistol with built-in suppressor made to fire LIFE Recovery Rounds. Its prototype status results in low LIFE recovery."
msgstr "内置消音器的特殊非致命手枪，发射生命值回复弹。因是试制品，回复量较低。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000008
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000009
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00000a
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000008
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000009
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00000a
msgid "Special non-lethal pistol with built-in suppressor made to fire LIFE Recovery Rounds. Modified to offer increased LIFE recovery."
msgstr "内置消音器的特殊非致命手枪，发射生命值回复弹。经改造回复量提升。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00000b
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00000b
msgid "Special non-lethal pistol with built-in suppressor made to fire PSYCHE Recovery Rounds. Its prototype status results in low PSYCHE recovery."
msgstr "内置消音器的特殊非致命手枪，发射精神回复弹。因是试制品，回复量较低。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00000c
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00000d
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00000e
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00000c
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00000d
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00000e
msgid "Special non-lethal pistol with built-in suppressor made to fire PSYCHE Recovery Rounds. Modified to offer increased PSYCHE recovery."
msgstr "内置消音器的特殊非致命手枪，发射精神回复弹。经改造回复量提升。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00000f
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00000f
msgid "Large-caliber combat pistol. Powerful enough to temporarily incapacitate even heavily armored soldiers."
msgstr "大口径战斗手枪。威力足以让重甲士兵暂时失去行动力。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000010
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000010
msgid "Large-caliber combat pistol. Powerful enough to temporarily incapacitate even heavily armored soldiers. Equipped with suppressor."
msgstr "大口径战斗手枪。威力足以让重甲士兵暂时失去行动力。带消音器。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000011
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000011
msgid "Large-caliber combat pistol. Upgraded custom model of the M1911A1 featuring greater accuracy and damage."
msgstr "大口径战斗手枪。M1911A1的升级定制版，精度与伤害更高。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000012
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000013
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000012
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000013
msgid "Large-caliber combat pistol. Upgraded custom model of the M1911A1 featuring greater accuracy and damage. Equipped with suppressor."
msgstr "大口径战斗手枪。M1911A1的升级定制版，精度与伤害更高。带消音器。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000014
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000014
msgid "Medium-caliber combat pistol. Compact and easy to carry, so it won't impede your sneaking."
msgstr "中口径战斗手枪。小巧易携，不影响潜行。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000015
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000016
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000015
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000016
msgid "Medium-caliber combat pistol. Compact and easy to carry, so it won't impede your sneaking. Equipped with suppressor that does not wear with use."
msgstr "中口径战斗手枪。小巧易携，不影响潜行。消音器不会随使用损耗。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000017
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000017
msgid "Highly reliable combat revolver. While its massive power will knock enemies off their feet, it has considerable recoil."
msgstr "高可靠性战斗左轮。巨大威力可将敌人击倒，但后坐力也很大。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000018
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000018
msgid "Highly reliable combat revolver. While its massive power will knock enemies off their feet, it has considerable recoil. The longer barrel increases accuracy."
msgstr "高可靠性战斗左轮。巨大威力可将敌人击倒，但后坐力也很大。加长枪管提升精度。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000019
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000019
msgid "Highly reliable combat revolver. While its massive power will knock enemies off their feet, it has considerable recoil. The laser sight enables easier targeting."
msgstr "高可靠性战斗左轮。巨大威力可将敌人击倒，但后坐力也很大。激光瞄准器便于瞄准。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00001a
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00001a
msgid "Hand cannon that fires grenades. Though small and single-shot, it can hold its own against armored vehicles."
msgstr "发射榴弹的手炮。虽小巧且单发，仍可对抗装甲车。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00001b
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00001b
msgid "Hand cannon that fires grenades. Though small and single-shot, it can hold its own against armored vehicles. The rifle stock increases accuracy."
msgstr "发射榴弹的手炮。虽小巧且单发，仍可对抗装甲车。枪托提升精度。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00001c
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00001c
msgid "Large-frame machine pistol. Good for temporarily incapacitating soldiers. Can be modified through R&D into a full-auto model."
msgstr "大型冲锋手枪。可暂时使士兵失去战斗力。可通过研发改造为全自动型号。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00001d
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00001d
msgid "Large-frame machine pistol. Full-auto model. Firepower is greatly increased, but so is the recoil. In addition, the shorter barrel reduces accuracy."
msgstr "大型冲锋手枪。全自动型号。火力大幅提升，但后坐力也随之增大。此外，枪管较短导致精度下降。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00001e
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00001e
msgid "Large-frame machine pistol. Full-auto model. Firepower is greatly increased, but so is the recoil. Increased magazine capacity."
msgstr "大型冲锋手枪。全自动型号。火力大幅提升，但后坐力也随之增大。弹匣容量增加。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00001f
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00001f
msgid "Support supply request marker. Fired and set like a weapon. Once set, press <I=HHA> to receive ammo and items. Heroism decreases with overuse."
msgstr "支援补给请求标记。像武器一样发射并设置。设置后按<I=HHA>可接收弹药和物品。过度使用会降低英雄度。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000020
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000021
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000020
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000021
msgid "Support supply request marker.  Heroism decreases with overuse.  Modified to carry additional rounds."
msgstr "支援补给请求标记。过度使用会降低英雄度。已改造以携带更多弹药。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000022
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000022
msgid "Support strike request marker. Fired and set like a weapon. Once set, press <I=HHA> to execute strike. Heroism decreases with overuse."
msgstr "支援打击请求标记。像武器一样发射并设置。设置后按<I=HHA>可执行打击。过度使用会降低英雄度。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000023
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000024
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000023
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000024
msgid "Support strike request marker.  Heroism decreases with overuse.  Modified to carry additional rounds."
msgstr "支援打击请求标记。过度使用会降低英雄度。已改造以携带更多弹药。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000025
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000025
msgid "Delicious and nutritious fruit. Product of Costa Rica."
msgstr "美味又营养的水果。哥斯达黎加产。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000026
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000027
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000026
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000027
msgid "Large-bore combat pistol."
msgstr ""

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000029
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000029
msgid "Double-barreled shotgun. Though powerful, it lacks range and only holds two rounds."
msgstr "双管霰弹枪。威力虽大，但射程不足，且只能装两发。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00002a
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00002a
msgid "Double-barreled shotgun. The sawed-off barrel makes it easier to handle. Reload speed can be increased through R&D."
msgstr "双管霰弹枪。锯短枪管使其更易操作。可通过研发提升装填速度。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00002b
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00002c
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00002d
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00002b
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00002c
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00002d
msgid "Double-barreled shotgun. The sawed-off barrel makes it easier to handle. Reload speed has been increased."
msgstr "双管霰弹枪。锯短枪管使其更易操作。装填速度已提升。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00002e
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00002f
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000030
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00002e
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00002f
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000030
msgid "Double-barreled shotgun that fires rubber slugs. Non-lethal. The sawed-off barrel makes it easier to handle. Reload speed can be increased through R&D."
msgstr "发射橡胶弹的双管霰弹枪。非致命。锯短枪管使其更易操作。可通过研发提升装填速度。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000031
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000031
msgid "Lightweight pump-action shotgun. Can fire four rounds in rapid succession."
msgstr "轻型泵动霰弹枪。可快速连续射击四发。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000032
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000032
msgid "Lightweight pump-action shotgun. Modified to hold seven rounds. Firepower is also greatly increased."
msgstr "轻型泵动霰弹枪。已改造为可装七发。火力也大幅提升。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000033
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000034
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000033
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000034
msgid "Lightweight pump-action shotgun. Equipped with suppressor in addition to its increased capacity. Overall power is also greater."
msgstr "轻型泵动霰弹枪。除容量增加外还配备了消音器。整体威力也更强。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000035
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000035
msgid "Lightweight pump-action shotgun. Its longer barrel decreases spread, allowing shots to connect from greater distances. The rifle stock also increases accuracy."
msgstr "轻型泵动霰弹枪。较长的枪管减小了散布，可从更远距离命中目标。枪托也提升了精度。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000036
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000036
msgid "Lightweight pump-action shotgun. Equipped with scope. Combines the features of a shotgun with added range."
msgstr "轻型泵动霰弹枪。配有瞄准镜。兼具霰弹枪特性与更远射程。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000037
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000037
msgid "Automatic shotgun. Holds six rounds. Its rapid-fire capability brings immense  firepower, but it is difficult to handle."
msgstr "自动霰弹枪。装弹六发。连射能力带来巨大火力，但难以操控。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000038
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000039
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000038
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000039
msgid "Automatic shotgun. Modified to hold eight rounds. Its rapid-fire capability brings immense firepower, but it is difficult to handle."
msgstr "自动弹枪。经改造装弹八发。连射能力带来巨大火力，但难以操控。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00003a
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00003a
msgid "Prototype full-auto shotgun. Its outstanding capacity and firing speed make it the most powerful shotgun in the world."
msgstr "试作型全自动霰弹枪。出色的装弹量与射速使其成为世上最强的霰弹枪。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00003d
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00003d
msgid "Large-caliber submachine gun. Requires both hands to use, preventing the use of a shield, but it is both easy to handle and accurate."
msgstr "大口径冲锋枪。需双手持用，无法同时使用盾牌，但易于操控且精准。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00003e
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00003e
msgid "Large-caliber submachine gun. Requires both hands to use, preventing the use of a shield, but the addition of a grip increases accuracy."
msgstr "大口径冲锋枪。需双手持用，无法同时使用盾牌，但加装握把提升了精准度。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00003f
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00003f
msgid "Large-caliber submachine gun. Requires both hands to use, preventing the use of a shield, but the addition of a grip increases accuracy. Increased magazine capacity."
msgstr "大口径冲锋枪。需双手持用，无法同时使用盾牌，但加装握把提升了精准度。弹匣容量增加。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000040
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000040
msgid "Compact, lightweight submachine gun. Its high firing speed makes it effective at stopping the enemy, but it suffers from low accuracy."
msgstr "紧凑轻便的冲锋枪。射速高，能有效压制敌人，但精度较低。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000041
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000041
msgid "Compact, lightweight submachine gun. Its high firing speed makes it effective at stopping the enemy, but it suffers from low accuracy. Equipped with suppressor."
msgstr "紧凑轻便的冲锋枪。射速高，能有效压制敌人，但精度较低。配备消音器。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000042
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000042
msgid "Compact, lightweight submachine gun. Its high firing speed makes it effective at stopping the enemy. The barrel jacket increases accuracy."
msgstr "紧凑轻便的冲锋枪。射速高，能有效压制敌人。枪管护套提升了精度。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000043
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000043
msgid "High-precision submachine gun. Possessing the same firing mechanism as an assault rifle, it is the most accurate submachine gun in the world."
msgstr "高精度冲锋枪。采用与突击步枪相同的击发机构，是世上最精准的冲锋枪。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000044
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000044
msgid "High-precision submachine gun. Possessing the same firing mechanism as an assault rifle, it is the most accurate submachine gun in the world. Equipped with suppressor."
msgstr "高精度冲锋枪。采用与突击步枪相同的击发机构，是世上最精准的冲锋枪。配有消音器。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000045
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000045
msgid "High-precision submachine gun, the most accurate in the world. Its built-in suppressor ensures a continuous silencing effect."
msgstr "高精度冲锋枪，世上最精准。内置消音器可持续消音。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000046
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000046
msgid "Compact, lightweight submachine gun. Has low recoil and wide AUTO AIM range, but low shot-for-shot power as well."
msgstr "紧凑轻便的冲锋枪。后坐力小、自动瞄准范围广，但单发威力也低。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000047
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000048
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000047
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000048
msgid "Compact, lightweight submachine gun. Has low recoil and wide AUTO AIM range, but low shot-for-shot power as well. Equipped with suppressor."
msgstr "紧凑轻便的冲锋枪。后坐力小、自动瞄准范围广，但单发威力也低。配有消音器。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00004b
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000231
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000232
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000233
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00004b
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000231
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000232
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000233
msgid "Compact & lightweight submachine gun."
msgstr ""

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00004c
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00004d
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00004c
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00004d
msgid "New-model, lightweight assault rifle. Highly accurate and can be equipped with a variety of parts through R&D."
msgstr "新型轻量突击步枪。精准度高，可通过研发加装多种配件。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00004e
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00004e
msgid "New-model, lightweight assault rifle. Combines its high accuracy with a suppressor, increasing its usefulness in covert operations."
msgstr "新型轻量突击步枪。高精准度结合消音器，提升了隐秘行动的实用性。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00004f
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00004f
msgid "New-model, lightweight assault rifle. Outfitted with shotgun. Switch with the R button (for hunter control type, press <I=RIGH>)."
msgstr "新型轻量突击步枪。配有霰弹枪。用R键切换（猎人操作模式按<I=RIGH>）。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000050
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00005b
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000050
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00005b
msgid "Large-frame assault pistol modified from an M16. Though it has intense recoil and is difficult to handle, it possesses unlimited ammo."
msgstr "由M16改装的大口径突击手枪。后坐力强、难以操控，但弹药无限。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000051
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000051
msgid "New-model, lightweight assault rifle. Outfitted with shotgun and laser sight. Switch with the R button (for hunter control type, press <I=RIGH>)."
msgstr "新型轻量突击步枪。配有霰弹枪与激光瞄准器。用R键切换（猎人操作模式按<I=RIGH>）。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000052
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000052
msgid "M16a1_A(Shotgun)"
msgstr ""

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000053
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000053
msgid "New-model, lightweight assault rifle. Outfitted with grenade launcher. Switch with the R button (for hunter control type, press <I=RIGH>)."
msgstr "新型轻量突击步枪。配有榴弹发射器。用R键切换（猎人操作模式按<I=RIGH>）。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000054
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000055
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000054
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000055
msgid "New-model, lightweight assault rifle. Outfitted with grenade launcher and laser sight. Switch with the R button (for hunter control type, press <I=RIGH>)."
msgstr "新型轻量突击步枪。配有榴弹发射器与激光瞄准器。用R键切换（猎人操作模式按<I=RIGH>）。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000056
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000056
msgid "M16a1_B(Grenader) "
msgstr "M16A1B（榴弹）"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000057
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000057
msgid "New-model, lightweight assault rifle. Outfitted with smoke grenade launcher. Switch with the R button (for hunter control type, press <I=RIGH>)."
msgstr "新型轻量突击步枪。配有烟雾弹发射器。用R键切换（猎人操作模式按<I=RIGH>）。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000058
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000059
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000058
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000059
msgid "New-model, lightweight assault rifle. Outfitted with smoke grenade launcher and laser sight. Switch with the R button (for hunter control type, press <I=RIGH>)."
msgstr "新型轻量突击步枪。配有烟雾弹发射器与激光瞄准器。用R键切换（猎人操作模式按<I=RIGH>）。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00005a
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00005a
msgid "M16a1_C(Smoke Grenader)"
msgstr "M16a1_C(Smoke Grenader)"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00005c
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00005c
msgid "Compact, lightweight carbine. Highly accurate and easy to handle. Can be equipped with a variety of parts through R&D."
msgstr "紧凑轻便的卡宾枪。精度高、易操作。可通过研发加装多种配件。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00005d
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00005d
msgid "Compact, lightweight carbine. Highly accurate and easy to handle. Equipped with suppressor through R&D."
msgstr "紧凑轻便的卡宾枪。精度高、易操作。已通过研发加装消音器。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00005e
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00005f
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00005e
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00005f
msgid "Compact, lightweight carbine. Outfitted with grenade launcher. Switch with the R button (for hunter control type, press <I=RIGH>)."
msgstr "紧凑轻便的卡宾枪。配备榴弹发射器。按R键切换（猎人操作模式按<I=RIGH>）。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000060
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000061
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000060
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000061
msgid "Compact, lightweight carbine. Outfitted with underbarrel shotgun. Switch with the R button (for hunter control type, press <I=RIGH>)."
msgstr "紧凑轻便的卡宾枪。配备下挂式霰弹枪。按R键切换（猎人操作模式按<I=RIGH>）。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000062
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000063
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000062
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000063
msgid "Compact, lightweight carbine. Outfitted with smoke grenade launcher. Switch with the R button (for hunter control type, press <I=RIGH>)."
msgstr "紧凑轻便的卡宾枪。配备烟雾榴弹发射器。按R键切换（猎人操作模式按<I=RIGH>）。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000064
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000064
msgid "Soviet assault rifle. Its massive firepower is effective at stopping the enemy, but its strong recoil reduces accuracy."
msgstr "苏联突击步枪。强大火力能有效压制敌人，但后坐力大、精度下降。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000065
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000065
msgid "Soviet assault rifle. Equipped with grenade launcher. Switch with the R button (for hunter control type, press <I=RIGH>)."
msgstr "苏联突击步枪。配备榴弹发射器。按R键切换（猎人操作模式按<I=RIGH>）。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000066
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00006a
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00006b
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000066
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00006a
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00006b
msgid "Romanian assault rifle. Equipped with a recoil buffer on the stock, maintaining its power while reducing recoil."
msgstr "罗马尼亚突击步枪。枪托装有缓冲器，保持威力的同时减小后坐力。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000067
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000068
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000067
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000068
msgid "Soviet assault rifle. Equipped with smoke grenade launcher. Switch with the R button (for hunter control type, press <I=RIGH>)."
msgstr "苏联突击步枪。配备烟雾榴弹发射器。按R键切换（猎人操作模式按<I=RIGH>）。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000069
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000069
msgid "Romanian assault rifle. Very powerful, but has strong recoil. Equipped with foregrip, increasing accuracy."
msgstr "罗马尼亚突击步枪。威力强大但后坐力大。配备前握把，提升精度。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00006c
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00006c
msgid "Soviet light machine gun. The long barrel means low recoil, but it is difficult to handle. Its powerful rounds are effective at stopping the enemy."
msgstr "苏联轻机枪。长枪管后坐力小，但难以操控。强力弹药能有效压制敌人。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00006d
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00006d
msgid "Soviet light machine gun. The long barrel means low recoil, but it is difficult to handle. Its powerful rounds are effective at stopping the enemy. Increased mag capacity."
msgstr "苏联轻机枪。长枪管后坐力小，但难以操控。强力弹药能有效压制敌人。弹容量增加。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00006e
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00006e
msgid "Large-caliber assault rifle. Difficult to handle but powerful. Has wide AUTO AIM range."
msgstr "大口径突击步枪。难以操控但威力强大。自动瞄准范围广。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00006f
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00006f
msgid "Large-caliber assault rifle. Powerful, with wide AUTO AIM range. The shorter barrel makes it easier to handle."
msgstr "大口径突击步枪。威力强大，自动瞄准范围广。枪管较短，更易操控。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000070
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000070
msgid "Large-caliber assault rifle. Powerful, with a wide AUTO AIM range. The laser sight enables easier targeting."
msgstr "大口径突击步枪。威力强大，自动瞄准范围广。激光瞄准器更易锁定目标。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000071
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000071
msgid "Bullpup assault rifle. While only moderately powerful, it is compact and easy to handle, with low recoil as well."
msgstr "无托突击步枪。威力一般，但紧凑易操控，后坐力也小。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000072
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000072
msgid "Prototype caseless assault rifle. Though its low recoil ammo enables easier targeting, it lacks power."
msgstr "无壳弹突击步枪原型。低后坐力弹药更易瞄准，但威力不足。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000073
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000073
msgid "A musket. When this gun hits its target, mysterious things may happen from time to time."
msgstr "火枪。当此枪命中目标时，偶尔会发生怪事。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000081
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000082
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000081
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000082
msgid "Compact & lightweight assault rifle."
msgstr ""

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000089
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000089
msgid "Large-caliber general purpose machine gun. Has a large capacity and can maintain high firepower, but its weight makes it hard to handle."
msgstr "大口径通用机枪。弹容量大、可持续输出火力，但重量大难以操控。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00008a
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00008a
msgid "Large-caliber general purpose machine gun. Though still heavy and hard to handle, its use of armor piercing also makes it an effective weapon against armored vehicles."
msgstr "大口径通用机枪。依然沉重难操控，但使用穿甲弹，对装甲车也有效。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00008b
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00008c
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00008b
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00008c
msgid "Large-caliber general purpose machine gun. A high capacity of armor piercing rounds maintains its firepower, and a shorter barrel makes it easier to handle."
msgstr "大口径通用机枪。大容量穿甲弹维持火力，枪管较短更易操控。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00008d
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00008d
msgid "Lightweight light machine gun. Uses armor piercing rounds, a big advantage against armored vehicles. The lightest machine gun in the world, making it easy to handle."
msgstr "轻型轻机枪。使用穿甲弹，对装甲车有巨大优势。世界最轻的机枪，易于操控。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00008e
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00008f
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00008e
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00008f
msgid "Lightweight light machine gun. Uses armor piercing rounds. The lightest machine gun in the world, making it easy to handle. The shorter barrel further improves handling."
msgstr "轻型轻机枪。使用穿甲弹。世界最轻的机枪，易于操控。枪管较短，操控性进一步提升。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000090
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000090
msgid "Soviet general purpose machine gun. Its high capacity allows it to maintain high firepower, but it is difficult to handle. Capacity can be increased."
msgstr "苏联通用机枪。大容量使其能持续输出高火力，但较难操控。可扩充容量。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000091
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000092
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000091
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000092
msgid "Soviet general purpose machine gun. Its high capacity allows it to maintain high firepower, but it is difficult to handle. Increased magazine capacity."
msgstr "苏联通用机枪。大容量使其能持续输出高火力，但较难操控。弹匣容量已扩充。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000093
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000093
msgid "Soviet general purpose machine gun. Its high capacity allows it to maintain high firepower, but it is difficult to handle. Highest capacity among machine guns."
msgstr "苏联通用机枪。大容量使其能持续输出高火力，但较难操控。机枪中容量最大。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000094
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000094
msgid "Soviet general purpose machine gun. Its high capacity allows it to maintain high firepower, and it is easier to handle with its shorter barrel."
msgstr "苏联通用机枪。大容量使其能持续输出高火力，枪管较短更易操控。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000095
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000095
msgid "Large-caliber general purpose machine gun. Its extremely fast firing speed gives it great power, but strong recoil makes it hard to control."
msgstr "大口径通用机枪。射速极快，威力巨大，但后坐力强难以控制。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000096
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000096
msgid "Large-caliber general purpose machine gun. Fast firing but strong recoil. Uses armor piercing rounds, which are effective against armored vehicles."
msgstr "大口径通用机枪。射速快但后坐力强。使用穿甲弹，对装甲车有效。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000097
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000098
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000097
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000098
msgid "Large-caliber general purpose machine gun. Uses armor piercing rounds. Its extremely fast firing speed gives it great power, but strong recoil makes it hard to control. Increased mag capacity."
msgstr "大口径通用机枪。使用穿甲弹。射速极快，威力巨大，但后坐力强难以控制。弹匣容量已扩充。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000099
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00009b
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000099
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00009b
msgid "Gatling machine gun. Its high firing speed well exceeds that of normal machine guns, but it is also heavier and harder to use."
msgstr "加特林机枪。射速远超普通机枪，但更重也更难使用。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00009a
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00009a
msgid "Special gun that crosses multiple EM waves to concentrate a mass of energy in one spot. Requires a CO-OPS teammate to produce the necessary interference."
msgstr "特殊枪械，可交叉多道电磁波将能量集中于一点。需合作任务队友制造必要的干扰。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00009c
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000237
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000238
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000239
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00009c
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000237
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000238
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000239
msgid "Large-bore general purpose machine gun"
msgstr ""

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00009f
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00009f
msgid "Large-caliber, automatic sniper rifle. While not the most accurate, its rapid fire capability allows for quick follow-up shots. Zoom can be adjusted. "
msgstr "大口径自动狙击步枪。精度不算最高，但射速快可迅速补射。可调整倍率。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000a0
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000a0
msgid "Large-caliber, automatic sniper rifle. While not the most accurate, it is capable of rapid fire and offers 3 levels of zoom."
msgstr "大口径自动狙击步枪。精度不算最高，但射速快，具备3级倍率。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000a1
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000a2
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000a1
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000a2
msgid "Large-caliber, automatic sniper rifle. While not the most accurate, it is capable of rapid fire. Uses PSYCHE Recovery Rounds. Offers 3 levels of zoom."
msgstr "大口径自动狙击步枪。精度不算最高，但射速快。使用精神恢复弹。具备3级倍率。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000a3
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000a3
msgid "Large-caliber, automatic sniper rifle. Uses armor piercing rounds effective against vehicles. Boasts high capacity, rapid fire, and high accuracy. Offers 3 levels of zoom."
msgstr "大口径自动狙击步枪。使用对车辆有效的穿甲弹。容量大、射速快、精度高。具备3级倍率。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000a4
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000a4
msgid "Large-caliber, automatic sniper rifle. Uses armor piercing rounds. Boasts high capacity, rapid fire, and high accuracy. Easier to handle with its shorter barrel."
msgstr "大口径自动狙击步枪。使用穿甲弹。容量大、射速快、精度高。枪管较短更易操控。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000a5
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000a5
msgid "Large-caliber, automatic sniper rifle. Uses armor piercing rounds. Boasts high capacity, rapid fire, and high accuracy. Equipped with suppressor."
msgstr "大口径自动狙击步枪。使用穿甲弹。容量大、射速快、精度高。配备消音器。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000a6
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000a6
msgid "High-precision, bolt-action sniper rifle. Uses armor piercing rounds, resulting in devastating power even against armored vehicles. Offers three levels of zoom."
msgstr "高精度栓动狙击步枪。使用穿甲弹，对装甲车也能造成毁灭性威力。具备3级倍率。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000a7
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000a8
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000a7
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000a8
msgid "High-precision, bolt-action sniper rifle. Uses armor piercing rounds, resulting in devastating power. The bull barrel helps reduce muzzle jump."
msgstr "高精度栓动狙击步枪。使用穿甲弹，威力毁灭性。重型枪管有助于减少枪口上跳。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000a9
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000aa
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000a9
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000aa
msgid "High-precision, bolt-action sniper rifle. Uses LIFE Recovery Rounds. Offers three levels of zoom."
msgstr "高精度栓动狙击步枪。使用生命值恢复弹。具备3级倍率。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000ab
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000ab
msgid "Tranquilizer sniper rifle. Can knock enemies out from a distance, but its bolt-action design does not allow for rapid fire. Zoom can be adjusted. "
msgstr "麻醉狙击步枪。可远距离击晕敌人，但栓动设计无法快速连射。可调整倍率。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000ac
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000ac
msgid "Tranquilizer sniper rifle. Can knock enemies out from a distance, but its bolt-action design does not allow for rapid fire. Offers three levels of zoom."
msgstr "麻醉狙击步枪。可远距离击晕敌人，但栓动设计无法快速连射。具备3级倍率。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000ad
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000ae
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000ad
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000ae
msgid "Tranquilizer sniper rifle. The skeleton stock results in a reduced weight."
msgstr "麻醉狙击步枪。骨架枪托减轻了重量。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000af
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000af
msgid "Tranquilizer sniper rifle. The suppressor provides an additional edge in long-range combat."
msgstr "麻醉狙击步枪。消音器为远距离战斗增添优势。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000b0
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000b0
msgid "Soviet large-caliber automatic sniper rifle. Its armor piercing bullets will penetrate helmets. Offers three levels of zoom."
msgstr "苏联大口径自动狙击步枪。穿甲弹可击穿头盔。具备3级倍率。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000b1
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000b1
msgid "Soviet large-caliber automatic sniper rifle. Uses armor piercing bullets for effective resistance against armored vehicles and is  relatively easy to handle."
msgstr "苏联大口径自动狙击步枪。使用穿甲弹，能有效对抗装甲车，且相对易于操控。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000b2
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000b2
msgid "Soviet large-caliber automatic sniper rifle. Uses armor piercing bullets and is relatively easy to handle. Increased magazine capacity."
msgstr "苏联大口径自动狙击步枪。使用穿甲弹，较易操控。弹匣容量增加。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000b3
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000b3
msgid "Soviet large-caliber automatic sniper rifle. Uses armor piercing bullets and is relatively easy to handle. The night-vision sight supports combat in the dark."
msgstr "苏联大口径自动狙击步枪。使用穿甲弹，较易操控。夜视瞄准镜支持夜间作战。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000b4
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000b4
msgid "Prototype bullpup automatic sniper rifle. Uses armor piercing rounds that can pierce even the thickest plating. Hard to handle but extremely accurate."
msgstr "无托式自动狙击步枪原型。使用穿甲弹，可击穿最厚的装甲。难以操控但精度极高。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000b5
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000b6
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000b5
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000b6
msgid "Prototype bullpup automatic sniper rifle. Uses armor piercing rounds. Hard to handle but extremely accurate. Offers three levels of zoom."
msgstr "无托式自动狙击步枪原型。使用穿甲弹。难以操控但精度极高。提供三级变焦。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000b7
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000b8
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000b7
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000b8
msgid "Large-caliber anti-tank rifle. Single-shot. Offers three levels of zoom. Its massive power easily tears through even thick metal."
msgstr "大口径反坦克步枪。单发。提供三级变焦。其巨大威力可轻易击穿厚金属。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000b9
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000b9
msgid "Large-caliber anti-tank rifle. Rapid-fire. Delivers an intense barrage of highly penetrating anti-tank rounds. Offers three levels of zoom."
msgstr "大口径反坦克步枪。速射。可倾泻密集的高穿透反坦克弹幕。提供三级变焦。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000ba
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000bb
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000bc
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000ba
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000bb
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000bc
msgid "Electromagnetic projectile acceleration system. Extremely powerful, but uses a lot of electricity.  Using an electrical supply from a CO-OPS teammate is ideal."
msgstr "电磁投射加速系统。威力极强，但耗电量大。最好由合作任务队友供电。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000bd
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000bd
msgid "Railgun remote charging system. Supplies electricity to a CO-OPS teammate's railgun after locking onto it. Press <I=ATK> repeatedly to increase output."
msgstr "轨道枪远程充电系统。锁定合作任务队友的轨道枪后为其供电。反复按<I=ATK>提高输出。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000cb
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000cb
msgid "Large-bore automatic sniper rifle. "
msgstr ""

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000cc
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000cd
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000ce
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000cf
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000cc
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000cd
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000ce
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000cf
msgid "Disposable rocket launcher. Compact and light, making it possible to carry several at once. A downside is its weak power."
msgstr "一次性火箭筒。小巧轻便，可同时携带数具。缺点是威力较弱。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000d0
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000d1
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000d2
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000d0
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000d1
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000d2
msgid "Four-round rocket launcher. Not that powerful round-for-round, but is capable of rapid fire. Has high overall firepower that can be unleashed in an instant."
msgstr "四发火箭筒。单发威力不强，但可速射。总火力高，可瞬间倾泻。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000d3
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000d3
msgid "Rocket-propelled grenade launcher. While not very accurate, it is powerful and it is easy to carry a relatively large number of rounds for it."
msgstr "火箭推进榴弹发射器。精度不高，但威力强大，且弹药较易大量携带。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000d4
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000d5
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000d6
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000d4
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000d5
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000d6
msgid "New-model rocket-propelled grenade launcher. Powerful and has easy-to-carry rounds. Though not that accurate, its scope enables easier targeting."
msgstr "新型火箭推进榴弹发射器。威力强大，弹药易携带。精度不高，但瞄准镜便于瞄准。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000d7
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000d7
msgid "Portable surface-to-air missile. Will automatically follow locked-on targets, so it is effective at attacking moving enemies. Lock-on can be upgraded."
msgstr "便携式地对空导弹。会自动追踪锁定的目标，对移动敌人有效。锁定性能可升级。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000d8
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000d9
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000d8
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000d9
msgid "New-model portable surface-to-air missile. Will automatically follow locked-on targets, so it is effective at attacking moving enemies. Lock-on can be upgraded."
msgstr "新型便携式地对空导弹。会自动追踪锁定的目标，对移动敌人有效。锁定性能可升级。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000da
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000db
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000dc
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000dd
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000da
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000db
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000dc
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000dd
msgid "Portable recoilless rifle. Has high initial shell velocity and accuracy, but takes a bit of time to reload."
msgstr "便携式无后坐力炮。炮弹初速与精度高，但装填需一些时间。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000de
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000df
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000e0
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000de
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000df
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000e0
msgid "Portable recoilless rifle. Has high initial shell velocity and accuracy. Uses HEAT rounds. This gives it wider damage radius but slightly less power."
msgstr "便携式无后坐力炮。初速高、精度好。使用破甲弹，杀伤范围大但威力略低。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000e1
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000e2
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000e3
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000e1
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000e2
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000e3
msgid "Portable recoilless rifle.  Uses Fulton recovery rounds. Connecting with a target will execute a Fulton recovery. (A maximum of 100 people can be recovered per mission)"
msgstr "便携式无后坐力炮。使用富尔顿回收弹。命中目标即执行富尔顿回收。（每次任务最多回收100人）"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000e4
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000e4
msgid "Portable anti-tank missile. Will automatically follow locked-on targets. Its powerful warhead makes it an extremely valuable asset in ground-to-ground combat."
msgstr "便携式反坦克导弹。会自动追踪锁定的目标。强力弹头使其在地对地战斗中极为宝贵。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000e5
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000e5
msgid "Special gun that renders its target optically invisible. Use it to hide your CO-OPS teammates. Runs on batteries."
msgstr "使目标光学隐形的特殊枪械。用于隐藏你的合作任务队友。使用电池。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000e6
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000e7
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000e6
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000e7
msgid "Special gun that renders its target optically invisible. Use it to hide your CO-OPS teammates. Increased battery size allows for extended use."
msgstr "使目标光学隐形的特殊枪械。用于隐藏你的合作任务队友。电池容量增加，可延长使用时间。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000e8
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000e8
msgid "4 player CO-OPS weapon. 2 posts and 1 band are required. The fourth person is the human bullet. Multiple posts can be equipped."
msgstr "4人合作任务武器。需要2根立柱和1条弹力带。第四人即人体炮弹。可装备多根立柱。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000e9
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000ea
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000eb
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000e9
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000ea
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x0000eb
msgid "With all players CO-OP In, set posts and band together, and then have the human bullet press <I=ACT>. Tap <I=ATK> to build up power. Can't be used alone as a weapon."
msgstr "所有玩家进入合作后，一起设置立柱和弹力带，然后由人体炮弹按<I=ACT>。连按<I=ATK>蓄力。无法单独作为武器使用。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
