#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000100
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000101
msgid "Sound and flash grenade. Non-lethal. Will knock enemy soldiers unconscious. R&D can increase power and blast radius."
msgstr "音爆闪光弹。非致命。可使敌兵昏迷。研发可提升威力与爆炸范围。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
