#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000105
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000106
msgid "Electronic scrambling grenade. Non-lethal. Temporarily prevents electronic equipment from functioning correctly. R&D can extend length of effect."
msgstr "电子干扰弹。非致命。可暂时使电子设备失灵。研发可延长效果时间。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
