#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00010e
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00010f
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000110
msgid "Colored smoke-producing grenade. Non-lethal. Smoke will obstruct enemy vision and temporarily hinder movement. R&D can increase time smoke is emitted. "
msgstr "彩色发烟手雷。非致命。烟雾可遮挡敌人视线并暂时妨碍移动。研发可延长发烟时间。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
