#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000114
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000115
msgid "Sleep gas grenade. Non-lethal. Emits a gas that induces sleep if inhaled. R&D can strengthen its effect."
msgstr "催眠瓦斯弹。非致命。释放吸入后令人昏睡的气体。研发可增强效果。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000116
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000116
msgid "Empty gun magazine. Non-lethal. The noise it makes when thrown can be used to distract enemies."
msgstr "空弹匣。非致命。投掷时的声响可用来引开敌人。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000117
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000117
msgid "Support supply request marker that is thrown. After throwing, press <I=HHA> to receive ammo and items. Heroism decreases with overuse."
msgstr "投掷式支援补给请求标记。投出后按<I=HHA>可获得弹药与道具。过度使用会降低英雄度。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000118
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000118
msgid "Support strike request marker that is thrown. After throwing, press <I=HHA> to execute strike. Heroism decreases with overuse."
msgstr "投掷式支援攻击请求标记。投出后按<I=HHA>发动攻击。过度使用会降低英雄度。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000119
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000119
msgid "Throw to release the net, and then press <I=HHA> to activate it. When a vehicle gets caught, flip the switches on the 4 devices to capture it."
msgstr "投出后展开网，再按<I=HHA>启动。车辆被网住后，扳动4个装置上的开关即可捕获。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
