#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00011b
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00011c
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00011d
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x00011e
msgid "Plastic explosive. Face location to be set, ready C4, then press <I=ATK> to set. After setting, press <I=HHA> at any time to detonate. R&D can increase power."
msgstr "塑胶炸药。面向设置位置，准备好C4后按<I=ATK>设置。设置后随时按<I=HHA>引爆。研发可提升威力。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
