#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000127
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000128
msgid "A popular magazine. Once set, anyone who notices it will stop to read it. The more issues set, the longer the person will be interested."
msgstr "热门杂志。放置后，看到的人会停下阅读。放置的期数越多，阅读时间越长。"

