#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000132
msgid "The pages are ingrained with the scent of countless delicacies, sending nearby wildlife into a trance."
msgstr "书页浸透了无数美食的香气，能让附近的野生动物神魂颠倒。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
