#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000135
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000137
msgid "A popular pulp magazine. Once set, anyone who notices it will stop to read it! Face location to be set, ready, then press <I=ATK> to set. "
msgstr "热门廉价杂志。放置后，看到的人会停下阅读！面向放置位置，准备后按<I=ATK>放置。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#. STAGEDAT entry 174, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
#: stage/23/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000136
#: stage/174/lang_weapon_text_en.olang/0x594864/0x000136
msgid "A magazine loaded with pictures of beautiful women. Once set, anyone who notices it will stop to read it! Face location to be set, ready, then press <I=ATK> to set. "
msgstr "印有美女照片的杂志。放置后，看到的人会停下阅读！面向放置位置，准备后按<I=ATK>放置。"

#. STAGEDAT entry 23, lang_weapon_text_en.olang -- written back by pwsf.stage_build into 009645fa.PDT
